«
@@ ============================================================
@@ SightRed — sight reduction: computed altitude and true azimuth of a body
@@ from an assumed position. Bowditch, The American Practical Navigator,
@@ appendix B.
@@ 
@@ Input : φ λ GHA Dec — assumed latitude and longitude (East positive), Greenwich
@@         hour angle and declination of the body. Plain numbers are degrees;
@@         angles with a unit are accepted.
@@ Output: Hc Zn — computed altitude, true azimuth from North.
@@ Angle mode and angle units setting are restored before returning.
@@ ============================================================

  4 →LIST « →Num IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN 1_° CONVERT UVAL END » MAP LIST→ DROP
  'AngleMode' RCL 'SetAngleUnits' RCL
  RAD NoAngleUnits
  Ⓒπ →Num 180 /
  → lat lon gha dcl amode aunits rdn
  «
    'lat*rdn' EVAL 'dcl*rdn' EVAL '(gha+lon)*rdn' EVAL
    → phi dlt lha
    «
      'ASIN(SIN(phi)*SIN(dlt)+COS(phi)*COS(dlt)*COS(lha))/rdn' EVAL 1_° *
      '((-COS(dlt)*SIN(lha))∠(SIN(dlt)*COS(phi)-COS(dlt)*SIN(phi)*COS(lha)))/rdn' EVAL
      360 MOD 1_° *
    »
    amode EVAL IF aunits THEN SetAngleUnits ELSE NoAngleUnits END
  »
»
